\newlabel{fig:trust-decay}{{2}{36}{Trust Decay Over Delegation Depth: Exponential decay curves showing trust attenuation $\mathcal {T}_{\text {del}}^{(d)} = \delta ^d \cdot \mathcal {T}_{i \to j}$ for decay factors $\delta \in \{0.5, 0.7, 0.8, 0.9\}$ over delegation chains of depth $d = 1$ to $10$. At $\delta = 0.8$, trust falls below $\tau =0.5$ at depth 4 and below $\tau =0.1$ at depth 11 (outside this plotted range). \textit {Note: Values are illustrative examples demonstrating the mathematical framework; specific decay factors should be tuned to deployment context.}}{fig:trust-decay}{}}
